# the SMK-37 Elite's KNOB BANK, FADER BANK, < and > (the HAL reads them into fm1_in.extra, tests/host/smk_input_test.c)
# change no page, piece, play or setting: KNOB BANK does nothing yet; FADER BANK, < and > are the pads' and faders'
# (pads.amb). Tapped, and held while others are tapped, on the home page and a layer's
wait 300
expect view 0
mark
tap KNOB_BANK
tap FADER_BANK
tap <
tap >
wait 300
expect view 0
expect piece 0
expect playing 1
expect marked 0
tap CHORD
wait 300
expect view 1
mark
press KNOB_BANK
press >
wait 300
tap <
tap FADER_BANK
wait 300
release KNOB_BANK
release >
wait 300
expect view 1
expect playing 1
expect marked 0
